{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":227617,"duration_api_ms":357759,"num_turns":22,"result":"All acceptance criteria are fully implemented and verified. Here is the JSON response:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"All acceptance criteria for organism death → detritus routing are already fully implemented. Shrimp death routing exists in shrimp.rs:626-656 (route_dead_shrimp_to_detritus), plant senescence routing in plant_growth.rs:387-389 (route_plant_loss_to_fine_detritus), and algae death routing in algae_growth.rs:277-279 (route_algae_loss_to_fine_detritus). The death_biomass_to_detritus_fraction parameter (default 1.0) exists in process.rs:218. Body composition constants are documented in budget.rs:5-35 (ADULT_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G, JUVENILE_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G, SHRIMP_N_MG_PER_G_WET_MASS, SHRIMP_C_MG_PER_G_WET_MASS, PLANT_N_MG_PER_G_BIOMASS, ALGAE_N_MG_PER_G_BIOMASS, LIVE_BIOMASS_ORGANIC_FRACTION_G_PER_G). All required unit and integration tests exist in budget_tracking.rs and shrimp_feeding_pathway.rs. Full test suite passes (0 failures), clippy clean.\",\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified shrimp death → detritus routing: route_dead_shrimp_to_detritus() at shrimp.rs:626-656 converts dead_count × body_mass → fine_detritus_g_total using live_biomass_detrital_mass_g() with N+C accounting. Reserve pool is proportionally transferred. death_biomass_to_detritus_fraction (1.0) gates the transfer with a debug_assert enforcing Phase 1 invariant.\",\n      \"order\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified plant senescence → detritus routing: route_plant_loss_to_fine_detritus() at plant_growth.rs:387-389 uses plant_detrital_mass_g() which sums plant_nitrogen_mg() + plant_carbon_mg() / 1000 → fine_detritus_g_total. Senescence is amplified by poor health_index. Loss is clamped to available biomass via clamp_partitioned_losses(). Both N and C are properly routed.\",\n      \"order\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified algae death → detritus routing: route_algae_loss_to_fine_detritus() at algae_growth.rs:277-279 uses algae_detrital_mass_g() which sums algae_nitrogen_mg() + algae_carbon_mg() / 1000 → fine_detritus_g_total. Both suspended algae (respiration + grazing losses) and periphyton (respiration + grazing + excess capacity losses) are routed. Both N and C properly accounted.\",\n      \"order\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified death_biomass_to_detritus_fraction parameter exists at process.rs:218 with default 1.0, serde-enabled for future schema evolution. Documentation in the field comment explains Phase 1 fixed-at-1.0 rationale.\",\n      \"order\": 4,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified body composition parameters are named and documented in budget.rs:5-35: ADULT_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G=0.12, JUVENILE_SHRIMP_BIOMASS_G=0.05, LIVE_BIOMASS_ORGANIC_FRACTION_G_PER_G=0.20, SHRIMP_N_MG_PER_G_WET_MASS≈27.6, SHRIMP_C_MG_PER_G_WET_MASS≈172.4, PLANT_N_MG_PER_G_BIOMASS=28.0, ALGAE_N_MG_PER_G_BIOMASS=35.0. Literature validation notes are included in doc comments.\",\n      \"order\": 5,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified unit test: test_shrimp_death_routes_body_mass_to_detritus_and_conserves_n_c() at budget_tracking.rs:1071 — kills shrimp under high stress, verifies detritus increases and total N/C conserved within 1e-6. Additionally test_shrimp_death_detritus_amount_matches_expected_body_mass() at line 1104 verifies exact detritus amounts match dead_count × body_mass.\",\n      \"order\": 6,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified unit test: test_plant_loss_routing_is_clamped_to_available_biomass_and_stays_particulate() at budget_tracking.rs:544 — sets extreme respiration+senescence rates to kill all plant biomass, verifies total N/C conserved within 1e-6 and detritus increases. Also test_trim_plants_preserves_n_and_c_when_routed_to_detritus() at line 577.\",\n      \"order\": 7,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified unit test: test_algae_loss_routing_is_clamped_to_available_biomass_and_stays_particulate() at budget_tracking.rs:509 — sets extreme respiration rate with high grazing to kill all algae biomass, verifies total N/C conserved within 1e-6 and detritus increases.\",\n      \"order\": 8,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Verified integration test: test_high_mortality_200_hours_conserves_n_c_and_accumulates_detritus() at budget_tracking.rs:1187 — runs 200 hours (8×25h blocks) with high temperature (33°C), elevated ammonia, low DO, active microbes. Checks N/C conservation at each 25-hour checkpoint (tolerance <0.5mg) and verifies population decline.\",\n      \"order\": 9,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Ran full test suite: all tests pass (0 failures across all crates). Ran cargo clippy: no warnings. No code changes needed — all acceptance criteria were already implemented.\",\n      \"order\": 10,\n      \"status\": \"completed\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"validation_evidence\": [\n    \"cargo test --test budget_tracking -- test_shrimp_death test_algae_loss_routing test_plant_loss_routing test_high_mortality: 5 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"cargo test --test shrimp_feeding_pathway -- shrimp_mortality: 1 passed, 0 failed (shrimp_mortality_transfers_reserve_to_detritus)\",\n    \"cargo test (full suite): all test results ok, 0 failures across 36 test binaries\",\n    \"cargo clippy: no warnings, clean output\",\n    \"Shrimp death routing verified at shrimp.rs:626-656 with live_biomass_detrital_mass_g() for body mass and proportional reserve transfer\",\n    \"Plant senescence routing verified at plant_growth.rs:387-416 with plant_detrital_mass_g() summing N+C\",\n    \"Algae death routing verified at algae_growth.rs:277-279 with algae_detrital_mass_g() summing N+C\",\n    \"death_biomass_to_detritus_fraction parameter verified at process.rs:218, default 1.0, with Phase 1 invariant enforcement via debug_assert\",\n    \"Body composition constants verified at budget.rs:5-35 with literature-validated doc comments\"\n  ],\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"The shrimp body mass N:C ratio uses feed_n_to_c_ratio (0.16) rather than a shrimp-specific body composition ratio. This is a simplification noted in the code — shrimp tissue may have a different N:C than feed. A future refinement could add a shrimp_body_n_to_c_ratio parameter.\",\n    \"Phosphorus is not explicitly tracked in detritus pools. When detritus dissolves, P is released at a fixed FEED_P_TO_N_MASS_RATIO (0.10) which may not match actual organism tissue P:N ratios. This is an existing system-wide limitation, not specific to this bead.\",\n    \"Mortality probability is clamped at 0.5 per daily step, so even with base_mortality=1.0, not all shrimp die in a single step. The test at line 1163 accounts for this but it means mass extinction scenarios play out over multiple days.\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"17d3291b-7637-4a5e-9ffe-0b0ecef971cb","total_cost_usd":1.4202625500000003,"usage":{"input_tokens":13,"cache_creation_input_tokens":56805,"cache_read_input_tokens":632866,"output_tokens":6754,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":56805,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":8395,"outputTokens":21466,"cacheReadInputTokens":2114133,"cacheCreationInputTokens":202196,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.5798832999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":13,"outputTokens":6754,"cacheReadInputTokens"